const sourceCode = "# Individual Packages\n\nFor smaller bundle sizes, you can install only the specific icon packs you need. All packages are scoped under `@boxicons-pro`.\n\n### Package Naming Convention\n```\n@boxicons-pro/svelte-{pack}-{style}[-{weight}]\n```\n\n- Weight is omitted for normal (400) weight\n- `thin` suffix for 200 weight\n- `bold` suffix for 700 weight\n\n### Available Packages\n\n#### Basic Icons\n```bash\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-regular\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-regular-thin\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-regular-bold\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-rounded\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-rounded-thin\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-rounded-bold\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-sharp\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-sharp-thin\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-sharp-bold\n```\n\n#### Filled Icons\n```bash\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-regular\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-regular-thin\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-regular-bold\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-rounded\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-sharp\n# ... and more\n```\n\n#### Duotone Icons\n```bash\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-regular\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-regular-thin\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-regular-bold\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-rounded\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-sharp\n# ... and more\n```\n---\n\n#### Brands\n```bash\nnpm install @boxicons-pro/svelte-brands\n```\n\n---\n\n### Usage with Individual Packages\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  // Import from specific packages\n  import { Alarm } from '@boxicons-pro/svelte-basic-regular';\n  import { Heart } from '@boxicons-pro/svelte-filled-rounded-bold';\n  import { Bell } from '@boxicons-pro/svelte-duotone-solid-sharp-thin';\n  import { Github } from '@boxicons-pro/svelte-brands';\n</script>\n\n<div>\n  <Alarm size=\"lg\" />\n  <Heart size=\"lg\" fill=\"red\" />\n  <Bell \n    size=\"lg\" \n    primaryFill=\"#3b82f6\" \n    secondaryFill=\"#93c5fd\" \n  />\n  <Github size=\"lg\" />\n</div>\n```\n\n### Benefits\n\n- **Smaller bundle size**: Only include the exact icon variants you need\n- **Faster builds**: Less code to process and bundle\n- **Better tree-shaking**: Pre-filtered packages are easier for bundlers to optimize\n- **Type safety**: Each package has its own TypeScript definitions";
